in="34.880" end="34.980">ん</span></span></span><span begin="34.980" end="35.100">く</span><span begin="35.100" end="35.220">ら</span><span begin="35.220" end="35.320">い</span><span begin="35.320" end="35.440">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">逃</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.440" end="35.680">に</span></span></span><span begin="35.680" end="35.760">げ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.760" end="35.863">だ</span></span></span><span begin="35.863" end="36.013">す</span><span begin="36.013" end="36.200">だ</span><span begin="36.200" end="36.490">ろ</span><span begin="36.490" end="36.780">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">都会开逃吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hanbun kurai wa nigedasu darō</span></p><p begin="37.180" end="38.100" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.180" end="37.380">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">件</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.380" end="37.440">け</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.440" end="37.580">ん</span></span></span><span begin="37.580" end="37.680">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">陰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.680" end="37.820">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.820" end="37.880">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">謀</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.880" end="38.040">ぼ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.040" end="38.100">う</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">阴谋诡计</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">jiken no inbō</span></p><p begin="38.100" end="39.040" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">完</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.100" end="38.240">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.240" end="38.340">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.340" end="38.460">ぜ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.460" end="38.620">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">犯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.620" end="38.660">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.660" end="38.780">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">罪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.780" end="38.920">ざ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.920" end="39.040">い</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">完全犯罪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kanzen hanzai</span></p><p begin="39.040" end="40.540" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.040" end="39.120">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.120" end="39.230">ちゅ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.230" end="39.340">う</span></span></span><span begin="39.340" end="39.460">の</span><span begin="39.460" end="39.640">ダー</span><span begin="39.640" end="39.760">ク</span><span begin="39.760" end="39.860">マ</span><span begin="39.860" end="40.240">ター</span><span begin="40.240" end="40.540">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">宇宙的暗物质</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">uchū no dāku matā mo</span></p><p begin="40.620" end="43.040" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.620" end="40.860">す</span><span begin="40.860" end="40.980">ま</span><span begin="40.980" end="41.220">し</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.220" e