="x-translation">如果世界是由秘密构成的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sekai ga himitsu de tsukurarete iru nara</span></p><p begin="58.553" end="1:04.000" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.553" end="58.793">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="58.793" end="58.900">だ</span></span></span><span begin="58.900" end="59.160">し</span><span begin="59.160" end="59.440">さ</span><span begin="59.440" end="59.900">と</span><span begin="59.900" end="1:00.340">は</span><span begin="1:00.340" end="1:01.020">な</span><span begin="1:01.020" end="1:01.240">ん</span><span begin="1:01.240" end="1:01.660">な</span><span begin="1:01.660" end="1:01.840">の</span><span begin="1:01.840" end="1:04.000">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">那什么才是正确的啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tadashisa to wa nan na no sa</span></p><p begin="1:04.780" end="1:13.400" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.780" end="1:06.540">70</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">億</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.540" end="1:06.740">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.740" end="1:07.220">く</span></span></span><span begin="1:07.220" end="1:08.060">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">秘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.200" end="1:08.820">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">密</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.820" end="1:09.160">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.160" end="1:09.640">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.640" end="1:09.990">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">同</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.990" end="1:10.340">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.340" end="1:10.780">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.780" end="1:11.540">じ</span><span begin="1:11.860" end="1:12.340">だ</span><span begin="1:12.340" end="1:12.780">け</span><span begin="1:12.780" end="1:13.400">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为什么开始变得想要</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nanajū oku no himitsu to onaji dake no</span></p><p begin="1:13.400" end="1:18.580" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">純</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.400" end="1:13.700">じゅ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.700" end="1:13.800">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">粋</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.800" end="1:14.120">す</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.120" end="1:14.340">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.340" end="1:14.560">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.560" end="1:14.740">ほ</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.740" end="1:15.000">し</span><span begin="1:15.000" end="1:15.220">く</span><span begin="1:15.220" end="1:15.680">な</span><span begin="1:15.680" end="1:15.880">る</span><span begin="1:15.880" end="1:16.100">の</span><span begin="1:16.100" end="1:17.260">は</span><span begin="1:17.640" end="1:17.900">何</span><span begin="1:17.900" end="1:18.580">故？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">和70亿的秘密一样的纯净？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">junsui ga hoshiku naru no wa naze?</span></p><p begin="1:18.980" end="1:22.280" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.980" end="1:19.500">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.500" end="1:19.880">に</span></span></span><span begin="1:19.880" end="1:20.480">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.480" end="1:20.780">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:20.780" end="1:21.040">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">義</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:21.040" end="1:21.420">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="1:21.420" end="1:22.280">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">不知道什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nani ga seigi ka</span></p><p begin="1:22.480" end="1:26.620" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.480" end="1:22.760">そ</span><span begin="1:22.760" end="1:23.000">ん</span><span begin="1:23.000" end="1:23.300">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">馬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.420" end="1:23.680">ば</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鹿</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.680" end="1:23.860">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.860" end="1:24.070">しょ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.070" end="1:24.280">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">直</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.280" end="1:24.520">じ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:24.520" end="1:24.740">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:24.740" end="1:25.020">な</span><span begin="1:25.020" end="1:25.200">ふ</span><span begin="1:25.200" end="1:25.900">た</span><span begin="1:25.900" end="1:26.153">り</span><span begin="1:26.153" end="1:26.620">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才是正义的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna bakashōjiki na futari ga</span></p><p begin="1:26.760" end="1:32.340" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.760" end="1:27.020">わ</span><span begin="1:27.020" end="1:27.480">か</span><span begin="1:27.480" end="1:27.680">ら</span><span begin="1:27.680" end="1:27.920">な</span><span begin="1:27.920" end="1:28.120">い</span><span begin="1:28.120" end="1:28.560">よ</span><span begin="1:28.560" end="1:29.000">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">泣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:29.180" end="1:29.460">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:29.460" end="1:30.100">い</span><span begin="1:30.100" end="1:30.320">て</span><span begin="1:30.320" end="1:32.340">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">过分老实的两个人哭了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wakaranai yo to naiteru</span></p><p begin="1:33.980" end="1:37.620" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">信</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.980" end="1:34.300">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.300" end="1:34.520">ん</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.520" end="1:34.780">じ</span><span begin="1:34.780" end="1:35.000">て</span><span begin="1:35.000" end="1:35.240">な</span><span begin="1:35.240" end="1:35.440">ん</span><span begin="1:35.440" end="1:35.880">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:35.880" end="1:36.120">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:36.120" end="1:36.320">い</span><span begin="1:36.320" end="1:36.560">か</span><span begin="1:36.560" end="1:36.780">も</span><span begin="1:36.780" end="1:37.620">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">信任什么的或许不存在呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinjite nante nai kamo ne</span></p><p begin="1:41.180" end="1:44.700" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.180" end="1:41.440">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.440" end="1:41.580">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.580" end="1:41.920">し</span><span begin="1:41.920" end="1:42.080">て</span><span begin="1:42.080" end="1:42.360">な</span><span begin="1:42.360" end="1:42.560">ん</span><span begin="1:42.560" end="1:43.000">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:43.000" end="1:43.240">な</span></span></span><span begin="1:43.240" end="1:43.440">い</span><span begin="1:43.440" end="1:43.660">か</span><span begin="1:43.660" end="1:43.900">も</span><span begin="1:43.900" end="1:44.700">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">爱什么的或许也不存在呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aishite nante nai kamo ne</span></p><p begin="1:48.060" end="1:51.480" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">秘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.060" end="1:48.360">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">密</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.360" end="1:48.540">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:48.540" end="1:48.840">つ</span></span></span><span begin="1:48.840" end="1:49.020">の</span><span begin="1:49.020" end="1:49.320">ひ</span><span begin="1:49.320" end="1:49.540">と</span><span begin="1:49.540" end="1:49.840">つ</span><span begin="1:49.840" end="1:50.040">ふ</span><span begin="1:50.040" end="1:50.280">た</span><span begin="1:50.280" end="1:50.620">つ</span><span begin="1:50.620" end="1:50.900">く</span><span begin="1:50.900" end="1:51.200">ら</span><span begin="1:51.200" end="1:51.480">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">秘密啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">himitsu no hitotsu futatsu kurai</span></p><p begin="1:51.500" end="1:56.780" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:51.500" end="1:51.880">あ</span><span begin="1:51.880" end="1:52.263">る</span><span begin="1:52.263" end="1:52.720">か</span><span begin="1:52.720" end="1:53.460">ら</span><span begin="1:53.680" end="1:56.780">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">总是会有那么一两个的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aru kara ne</span></p><p begin="2:14.993" end="2:16.780" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">図</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:14.993" end="2:15.120">ず</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鑑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.120" end="2:15.260">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.260" end="2:15.340">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.340" end="2:15.480">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">載っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.480" end="2:15.580">の</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.580" end="2:15.660">っ</span></span></span><span begin="2:15.660" end="2:15.780">て</span><span begin="2:15.780" end="2:15.920">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.920" end="2:16.020">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.020" end="2:16.130">ちゅ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.130" end="2:16.240">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.240" end="2:16.340">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">話</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.340" end="2:16.460">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.460" end="2:16.540">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.540" end="2:16.680">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.680" end="2:16.780">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">每天阅读关于</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zukan ni notteta uchū no hanashi o</span></p><p begin="2:16.780" end="2:18.200" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">毎</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.780" end="2:16.940">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.940" end="2:17.000">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.000" end="2:17.120">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.120" end="2:17.240">ち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">読</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.240" end="2:17.380">よ</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.380" end="2:17.500">ん</span><span begin="2:17.500" end="2:17.560">で</span><span begin="2:17.560" end="2:17.680">い</span><span begin="2:17.680" end="2:18.200">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">宇宙的图鉴和藏书</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mainichi yonde ita</span></p><p begin="2:18.480" end="2:19.400" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.480" end="2:18.660">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.660" end="2:18.760">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.760" end="2:18.900">ご</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.900" end="2:19.000">の</span><span begin="2:19.000" end="2:19.160">ペー</span><span begin="2:19.160" end="2:19.300">ジ</span><span begin="2:19.300" end="2:19.400">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">以为最后一页</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saigo no pēji ni</span></p><p begin="2:19.400" end="2:21.640" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.400" end="2:19.560">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.560" end="2:19.660">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.660" end="2:19.760">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.760" end="2:19.860">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.860" end="2:19.980">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.980" end="2:20.100">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">理</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.100" end="2:20.220">り</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.220" end="2:20.330">が</span><span begin="2:20.330" end="2:20.440">あ</span><span begin="2:20.440" end="2:20.560">る</span><span begin="2:20.560" end="2:20.680">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.680" end="2:20.800">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.800" end="2:20.880">も</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.880" end="2:21.000">っ</span></span></span><span begin="2:21.000" end="2:21.100">て</span><span begin="2:21.100" end="2:21.240">い</span><span begin="2:21.240" end="2:21.640">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">记载着世界的真理</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sekai no shinri ga aru to omotte ita</span></p><p begin="2:21.840" end="2:23.860" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.840" end="2:22.000">で</span><span begin="2:22.000" end="2:22.100">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.100" end="2:22.220">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.220" end="2:22.340">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.340" end="2:22.420">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.420" end="2:22.540">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">経っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.540" end="2:22.700">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.700" end="2:22.800">っ</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.800" end="2:23.000">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">大</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.000" end="2:23.100">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.100" end="2:23.200">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.200" end="2:23.300">き</span><span begin="2:23.300" end="2:23.420">く</span><span begin="2:23.420" end="2:23.640">なっ</span><span begin="2:23.640" end="2:23.860">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">但随着时光流逝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">demo jikan ga tatte ōkiku natte</span></p><p begin="2:23.860" end="2:25.620" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.860" end="2:24.000">だ</span><span begin="2:24.000" end="2:24.100">ん</span><span begin="2:24.100" end="2:24.180">だ</span><span begin="2:24.180" end="2:24.330">ん</span><span begin="2:24.330" end="2:24.540">大</span><span begin="2:24.540" end="2:24.660">人</span><span begin="2:24.660" end="2:24.780">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">匂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.780" end="2:24.940">に</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.940" end="2:25.020">お</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.020" end="2:25.120">い</span><span begin="2:25.120" end="2:25.220">に</span><span begin="2:25.220" end="2:25.440">なっ</span><span begin="2:25.440" end="2:25.620">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">渐渐染上了大人的世俗后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dandan otona no nioi ni natte</span></p><p begin="2:25.620" end="2:28.440" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.620" end="2:25.800">そ</span><span begin="2:25.800" end="2:25.920">ん</span><span begin="2:25.920" end="2:26.100">な</span><span begin="2:26.100" end="2:26.220">こ</span><span begin="2:26.220" end="2:26.360">と</span><span begin="2:26.360" end="2:26.560">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">諦</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.560" end="2:26.760">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.760" end="2:27.000">き</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.000" end="2:27.200">ら</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.200" end="2:27.420">め</span><span begin="2:27.420" end="2:28.440">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就不在乎那些东西了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sonna koto wa akirameta</span></p><p begin="2:35.660" end="2:41.700" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:35.660" end="2:35.893">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:35.893" end="2:36.120">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.120" end="2:36.360">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:36.360" end="2:37.600">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">冷</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:37.820" end="2:38.120">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:38.120" end="2:38.320">め</span></span></span><span begin="2:38.320" end="2:38.580">た</span><span begin="2:38.580" end="2:38.780">い</span><span begin="2:38.780" end="2:39.080">ほ</span><span begin="2:39.080" end="2:39.220">ん</span><span begin="2:39.220" end="2:39.460">と</span><span begin="2:39.460" end="2:39.660">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">変</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:39.660" end="2:39.900">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:39.900" end="2:40.120">わ</span><span begin="2:40.120" end="2:40.340">る</span><span begin="2:40.340" end="2:40.560">な</span><span begin="2:40.560" end="2:41.700">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如果世界变得冷漠的话</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sekai ga tsumetai honto ni kawaru nara</span></p><p begin="2:43.340" end="2:48.840" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:43.340" end="2:43.680">し</span></span></span><span begin="2:43.680" end="2:43.880">ら</span><span begin="2:43.880" end="2:44.120">な</span><span begin="2:44.120" end="2:44.340">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">方</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.340" end="2:44.640">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:44.640" end="2:44.800">う</span></span></span><span begin="2:44.800" end="2:45.260">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:45.260" end="2:45.680">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:45.680" end="2:46.100">い</span><span begin="2:46.100" end="2:46.583">か</span><span begin="2:46.583" end="2:46.803">も</span><span begin="2:46.803" end="2:48.840">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">可能感觉不到才比较好吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shiranai hō ga ii kamo ne</span></p><p begin="2:49.640" end="2:56.420" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.640" end="2:50.520">たっ</span><span begin="2:50.520" end="2:51.200">た</span><span begin="2:51.200" end="2:51.440">ひ</span><span begin="2:51.440" end="2:51.660">と</span><span begin="2:51.660" end="2:52.100">つ</span><span begin="2:52.100" end="2:52.900">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">信</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.180" end="2:53.660">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:53.660" end="2:54.060">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:54.060" end="2:54.560">じ</span><span begin="2:54.560" end="2:54.980">る</span><span begin="2:54.980" end="2:55.220">こ</span><span begin="2:55.220" end="2:55.680">と</span><span begin="2:55.680" end="2:56.420">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">仅此唯一相信着的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tatta hitotsu o shinjiru koto wa</span></p><p begin="2:56.720" end="2:58.340" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.720" end="2:57.180">と</span><span begin="2:57.180" end="2:57.660">て</span><span begin="2:57.660" end="2:58.340">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">总不会</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">totemo</span></p><p begin="2:58.340" end="3:03.560" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">簡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.340" end="2:58.600">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.600" end="2:58.780">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">単</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:58.780" end="2:59.000">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.000" end="2:59.220">ん</span></span></span><span begin="2:59.220" end="2:59.440">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">事</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.440" end="2:59.660">こ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:59.660" end="2:59.860">と</span></span></span><span begin="2:59.860" end="3:00.100">じゃ</span><span begin="3:00.100" end="3:00.560">な</span><span begin="3:00.560" end="3:00.780">い</span><span begin="3:00.780" end="3:00.980">は</span><span begin="3:00.980" end="3:02.140">ず</span><span begin="3:02.320" end="3:02.580">だ</span><span begin="3:02.580" end="3:02.760">よ</span><span begin="3:02.760" end="3:03.560">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">是一件再也简单不过的事吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kantan na koto ja nai hazu da yo ne</span></p><p begin="3:03.880" end="3:07.200" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.880" end="3:04.780">大</span><span begin="3:04.780" end="3:05.420">人</span><span begin="3:05.420" end="3:05.660">に</span><span begin="3:05.660" end="3:05.920">な</span><span begin="3:05.920" end="3:06.340">れ</span><span begin="3:06.340" end="3:07.200">ば</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">虽然觉得变成大人以后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">otona ni nareba</span></p><p begin="3:07.420" end="3:13.000" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">全</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.420" end="3:07.700">ぜ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.700" end="3:07.880">ん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">部</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.880" end="3:08.340">ぶ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">忘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.340" end="3:08.500">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.500" end="3:08.800">す</span></span></span><span begin="3:08.800" end="3:09.000">れ</span><span begin="3:09.000" end="3:09.240">ら</span><span begin="3:09.240" end="3:09.440">れ</span><span begin="3:09.440" end="3:09.660">る</span><span begin="3:09.660" end="3:09.870">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:09.870" end="3:10.080">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:10.080" end="3:10.560">も</span></span></span><span begin="3:10.560" end="3:10.780">う</span><span begin="3:10.780" end="3:11.060">け</span><span begin="3:11.060" end="3:13.000">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就会全都忘记了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">zenbu wasurerareru to omou kedo</span></p><p begin="3:18.830" end="3:20.320" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.830" end="3:19.080">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">宙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.080" end="3:19.600">ちゅ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.600" end="3:19.740">う</span></span></span><span begin="3:19.740" end="3:20.320">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">如果宇宙是</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">uchū ga</span></p><p begin="3:20.520" end="3:25.220" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:20.520" end="3:20.760">ふ</span><span begin="3:20.760" end="3:20.980">た</span><span begin="3:20.980" end="3:21.240">り</span><span begin="3:21.240" end="3:21.480">き</span><span begin="3:21.480" end="3:21.680">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">食</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.680" end="3:21.920">た</span></span></span><span begin="3:21.920" end="3:22.140">べ</span><span begin="3:22.140" end="3:22.400">た</span><span begin="3:22.400" end="3:22.600">お</span><span begin="3:22.600" end="3:23.440">に</span><span begin="3:23.440" end="3:23.940">ぎ</span><span begin="3:23.940" end="3:24.200">り</span><span begin="3:24.200" end="3:25.220">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">两个人一起吃过的饭团</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">futari kiri tabeta onigiri no</span></p><p begin="3:26.073" end="3:31.520" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:26.073" end="3:26.333">海</span><span begin="3:26.333" end="3:26.560">苔</span><span begin="3:26.560" end="3:26.780">と</span><span begin="3:26.780" end="3:26.980">か</span><span begin="3:26.980" end="3:27.580">な</span><span begin="3:27.580" end="3:27.940">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">良</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:27.940" end="3:28.370">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:28.370" end="3:28.800">い</span><span begin="3:28.800" end="3:29.220">の</span><span begin="3:29.220" end="3:29.440">に</span><span begin="3:29.440" end="3:31.520">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">上的海苔那就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nori toka nara ii no ni ne</span></p><p begin="3:32.340" end="3:39.380" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:32.340" end="3:34.123">70</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">億</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.123" end="3:34.320">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.320" end="3:34.780">く</span></span></span><span begin="3:34.780" end="3:35.560">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">秘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.840" end="3:36.360">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">密</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.360" end="3:36.720">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:36.720" end="3:37.200">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:37.200" end="3:37.640">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">乗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:37.640" end="3:37.820">の</span></span></span><span begin="3:37.820" end="3:38.360">せ</span><span begin="3:38.360" end="3:39.380">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">承载着70亿的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nanajū oku no himitsu o nosete</span></p><p begin="3:39.620" end="3:46.240" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">小</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.620" end="3:39.840">ち</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:39.840" end="3:40.060">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:40.060" end="3:40.340">さ</span><span begin="3:40.340" end="3:40.920">な</span><span begin="3:40.980" end="3:41.240">こ</span><span begin="3:41.240" end="3:41.440">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.440" end="3:41.620">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:41.620" end="3:41.880">し</span></span></span><span begin="3:41.880" end="3:42.080">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">息</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.080" end="3:42.320">い</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:42.320" end="3:42.540">き</span></span></span><span begin="3:42.540" end="3:42.760">も</span><span begin="3:42.760" end="3:43.220">で</span><span begin="3:43.220" end="3:43.440">き</span><span begin="3:43.440" end="3:43.720">な</span><span begin="3:43.720" end="3:44.820">い</span><span begin="3:45.200" end="3:45.463">ま</span><span begin="3:45.463" end="3:46.240">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">小小的行星没有办法呼吸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chiisana kono hoshi wa iki mo dekinai mama</span></p><p begin="3:46.480" end="3:49.740" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:46.480" end="3:47.000">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:47.000" end="3:47.500">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:47.500" end="3:48.060">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">正</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.060" end="3:48.340">せ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.340" end="3:48.560">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">義</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:48.560" end="3:48.960">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="3:48.960" end="3:49.740">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">人类的正义</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hito no seigi mo</span></p><p begin="3:50.080" end="3:54.580" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:50.080" end="3:50.340">ど</span><span begin="3:50.340" end="3:50.500">う</span><span begin="3:50.500" end="3:50.840">せ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">人</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.000" end="3:51.240">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.240" end="3:51.440">と</span></span></span><span begin="3:51.440" end="3:51.660">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">数</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.660" end="3:51.900">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:51.900" end="3:52.120">ず</span></span></span><span begin="3:52.120" end="3:52.340">だ</span><span begin="3:52.340" end="3:52.580">け</span><span begin="3:52.580" end="3:52.920">あ</span><span begin="3:52.920" end="3:53.160">る</span><span begin="3:53.160" end="3:53.400">ん</span><span begin="3:53.400" end="3:53.700">だ</span><span begin="3:53.700" end="3:54.140">ろ</span><span begin="3:54.140" end="3:54.580">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">和人类的数量一样多的吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dōse hito no kazu dake aru n darō</span></p><p begin="3:55.180" end="4:05.050" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:55.180" end="3:55.420">ふ</span><span begin="3:55.420" end="3:55.660">た</span><span begin="3:55.660" end="3:55.880">り</span><span begin="3:55.880" end="3:56.100">で</span><span begin="3:56.100" end="3:56.340">ひ</span><span begin="3:56.340" end="3:56.540">と</span><span begin="3:56.540" end="3:56.780">つ</span><span begin="3:56.780" end="3:56.960">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">秘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:56.960" end="3:57.680">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">密</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.680" end="3:57.840">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:57.840" end="3:59.420">つ</span></span></span><span begin="3:59.860" end="4:00.783">に</span><span begin="4:00.783" end="4:01.680">な</span><span begin="4:02.120" end="4:02.740">ろ</span><span begin="4:02.740" end="4:05.050">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">两个人化作同一个秘密吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">futari de hitotsu no himitsu ni narō</span></p><p begin="4:05.070" end="4:08.720" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">信</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.070" end="4:05.410">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:05.410" end="4:05.683">ん</span></span></span><span begin="4:05.683" end="4:05.880">じ</span><span begin="4:05.880" end="4:06.080">て</span><span begin="4:06.080" end="4:06.320">な</span><span begin="4:06.320" end="4:06.540">ん</span><span begin="4:06.540" end="4:07.000">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:07.000" end="4:07.200">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:07.200" end="4:07.440">い</span><span begin="4:07.440" end="4:07.680">か</span><span begin="4:07.680" end="4:07.880">ら</span><span begin="4:07.880" end="4:08.720">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">信任什么的或许不存在呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shinjite nante nai kara ne</span></p><p begin="4:12.313" end="4:15.680" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.313" end="4:12.510">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:12.510" end="4:12.680">い</span></span></span><span begin="4:12.680" end="4:13.000">し</span><span begin="4:13.000" end="4:13.180">て</span><span begin="4:13.180" end="4:13.480">な</span><span begin="4:13.480" end="4:13.660">ん</span><span begin="4:13.660" end="4:14.120">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:14.120" end="4:14.340">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:14.340" end="4:14.580">い</span><span begin="4:14.580" end="4:14.740">か</span><span begin="4:14.740" end="4:15.000">ら</span><span begin="4:15.000" end="4:15.680">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">爱什么的或许也不存在呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">aishite nante nai kara ne</span></p><p begin="4:19.293" end="4:28.650" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.293" end="4:19.600">お</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.600" end="4:19.720">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:19.720" end="4:19.940">な</span></span></span><span begin="4:19.940" end="4:20.180">い</span><span begin="4:20.180" end="4:20.400">ふ</span><span begin="4:20.400" end="4:20.660">た</span><span begin="4:20.660" end="4:20.900">り</span><span begin="4:20.900" end="4:21.160">だ</span><span begin="4:21.160" end="4:21.420">け</span><span begin="4:21.420" end="4:21.700">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.700" end="4:21.940">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4:21.940" end="4:22.240">ば</span></span></span><span begin="4:22.240" end="4:22.620">け</span><span begin="4:22.620" end="4:22.980">る</span><span begin="4:22.980" end="4:23.380">の</span><span begin="4:23.380" end="4:23.880">か</span><span begin="4:23.880" end="4:24.140">も</span><span begin="4:24.840" end="4:28.650">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">或许只有这孩子俩才能解开秘密呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">osanai futari dake ga abakeru no kamo ne</span></p></div></body></tt>